<title>JAPAN: Idemitsu to cut Jan oil product wholesale price.</title>
<headline>Idemitsu to cut Jan oil product wholesale price.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Refiner Idemitsu Kosan Co Ltd said on Thursday it would cut the wholesale price for its oil products from January 1, reflecting softer crude oil prices and a higher yen against the dollar.</p>
<p>The wholesale price of gasoline, kerosene and gas oil would each be cut by 500 yen per kilolitre, Idemitsu said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the cut in prices, the first in six months, would bring the gasoline wholesale price to 91.3 yen per litre, while both kerosene and gas oil would be priced at 37.3 yen per litre.</p>
</text>
